{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2022-06-07 16:30:00', 'title': 'JUSTIN NEFF NAMED PRESIDENT OF MCGEE AIR SERVICES, A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF ALASKA AIRLINES', 'text': 'SEATTLE , JUNE 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS FOR MCGEE AIR SERVICES INC. TODAY NAMED JUSTIN NEFF PRESIDENT OF THE WHOLLY-OWNED GROUND OPERATIONS SUBSIDIARY OF ALASKA AIRLINES. NEFF JOINS MCGEE AFTER EIGHT YEARS WORKING AT ALASKA AIRLINES, MOST RECENTLY AS MANAGING DIRECTOR OF ENGINES, MATERIAL, COMPONENTS AND LEASE MANAGEMENT.'}